            "text": "The price of order L4 has 7 decimal places, but USDC holds 6, so it cannot be paid as written. Fix: Write the price as a plain decimal in the unit of the currency, such as \"0.25\" for 0.25 ETH, with no sign, exponent or separator and no more places than the currency has (18 for ETH, 6 for USDC)."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
