          "message": {
            "text": "The recipient of fee 1 of order O1, \"0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000000\", is the zero address, which no one holds; a fee sent there is lost. This is a best practice of this tool, not a rule in the pages it cites. Fix: Copy the address again from the wallet or the contract; send nothing to a zero address, which no one holds."
          },
          "locations": [
